{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Epic 2D Side-Scrolling Comedy Action-Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity is being harvested by a beauty-obsessed vampire empire hidden in the rings of Uranus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In ZetaZania, a massive space station built by sinister vampires, blood is power and perfection is law. As Earth\u2019s top operative, you must fight your way through a society of seductive monsters, cosmic witches, and ruthless elites to bring the entire system crashing down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595560/extras/c41783dcdb2f4dfef4c88b2a8b27efdf.poster.avif?t=1774006332\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595560/extras/c41783dcdb2f4dfef4c88b2a8b27efdf.webm?t=1774006332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595560/extras/c41783dcdb2f4dfef4c88b2a8b27efdf.mp4?t=1774006332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the Weirdest War in the Solar System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity is under attack\u2026 by the Sexy Vampire Pirates from Uranus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep within the planet\u2019s inner ring lies ZetaZania, a sprawling space station ruled by a twisted, beauty-obsessed vampire empire. Humans are harvested for their precious life elixir, and\u00a0<i>sexiness</i> is law.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Earth\u2019s top military operative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission:<br>Infiltrate. Fight. Climb the ranks. Destroy the empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595560/extras/fdb15be0bf069f8913a46fb858964b54.avif?t=1774006332\" width=854 height=350 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retro Action. Modern Feel.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, shoot, and fight your way through 60 handcrafted levels in a fast-paced 2D platforming adventure that blends classic gameplay with smooth, modern controls.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight, responsive retro-style movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying combat with escalating intensity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle-focused challenges where skill matters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional visual puzzles for additional upgrades</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple to play. Difficult to master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Secrets, Upgrades and Strange Deals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on optional puzzle challenges to encounter a mysterious figure. Make the right choices to unlock upgrades that can change how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595560/extras/a4f449c66978a521710ca2ddffaae2ab.avif?t=1774006332\" width=854 height=350 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Madness of ZetaZania</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle through 7 bizarre and dangerous districts, each with its own identity:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transportation Factories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scientific Laboratories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Department of Sexiness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Divine Sisters of the Mighty Moons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Sacred Few</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Queen\u2019s Palace</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >King\u2019s Lair</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each zone introduces new original artwork, enemies, and a unique boss encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595560/extras/4654c78b4c9474f6f8a637a1b47f57ea.poster.avif?t=1774006332\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595560/extras/4654c78b4c9474f6f8a637a1b47f57ea.webm?t=1774006332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595560/extras/4654c78b4c9474f6f8a637a1b47f57ea.mp4?t=1774006332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Cast You Won\u2019t Forget</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face more than 50 original enemies, each with distinct personalities and behaviours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From seductive space vampires to cosmic witches and strange alien creations, every encounter is designed to be memorable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595560/extras/bb4a1350194770d28b096f83c1678a90.avif?t=1774006332\" width=854 height=350 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Retro Style, Reimagined</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed 2D pixel art enhanced with layered lighting effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vibrant alien environments full of color and atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D pre-rendered cutscenes styled to match the pixel art world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nostalgic 90s-inspired aesthetic with modern visual polish</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595560/extras/6c35cb036c5afb5a7da2de7d359baf18.avif?t=1774006332\" width=854 height=350 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Story Packed with British Humour</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a universe filled with absurd lore and original comedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ruled by King Scrotumous Maximus, this society values beauty above all else, while humanity is reduced to a resource.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tone is strange and entirely unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595560/extras/1e9b3ed02b22e37331c0b1fab574b53e.poster.avif?t=1774006332\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595560/extras/1e9b3ed02b22e37331c0b1fab574b53e.webm?t=1774006332\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595560/extras/1e9b3ed02b22e37331c0b1fab574b53e.mp4?t=1774006332\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Immersive Soundtrack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a rich electronic score by Jonny Towers, combining modern production with retro sci-fi influence to bring the world of ZetaZania to life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why You\u2019ll Love It</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A completely original comedic sci-fi setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic platforming gameplay with modern refinement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of enemies, locations, and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strong focus on fun, creativity, and personality</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Excellent Blasting!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3595560/8a0fc0f59c42d63e6e4db9e63fecc59b2c8fcc07.jpg"},{"name